# NAME: ClaudeCode
# FORMAT: Mihomo / Clash.Meta classical text
# REVIEWED: 2026-11-01
# TOTAL: 24 (22 domain rules + 2 inbound IP ranges)
# SCOPE: Claude-specific hosts only; shared services follow existing routing rules.
# POLICY: Select the policy in the main configuration; this file has no policy names.
# SOURCES: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config
#          https://code.claude.com/docs/en/desktop#network-access-requirements
#          https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/ip-addresses
