#          https://ip.net.coffee/claude/site.html
#          https://github.com/viewer12/OverseasAI.list/blob/main/rule/Clash/OverseasAI/OverseasAI.list
# NOTES: See claude-code.md for scope, provenance and limits.
# No NTP/ASN/GEOSITE dependency. No guarantee for arbitrary MCP, WebFetch or custom API gateways.

# 核心域名：API、OAuth、SSO、下载更新、Chrome 桥接、MCP 和用户内容
